BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:8694e237062cd2c027f626a57dc8202f@events.appsterdam.rs
SUMMARY:Beer tour Amsterdam
DESCRIPTION:Join us at the biertocht in Amsterdam, we'll take route 1, the start point is **Gollem aan het water**\n\nWe'll walk this route:\n\- Gollem aan het water\n\- Tapzuid\n\- Dopey's elixer\n\- Café Gijs\n\- Biertuin oost\n\- Poesiat & Kater\n\- Bar Joost\n\- Brouwerij 't IJ\n\- Gollem aan het water\n\nPlease sign up using herfst@morebeer.nl\nhttps://www.facebook.com/biertochtamsterdam/\n\nExample email: [gist:ecec6db0fd33e27b667ef914c12512ce](https://gist.github.com/ekoontz/ecec6db0fd33e27b667ef914c12512ce)
DTSTART:20250928T130000
DTEND:20250928T180000
LOCATION:Entrepotdok 64, amsterdam
CLASS:PUBLIC
STATUS:CONFIRMED
ORGANIZER;CN="Eugene Koontz":MAILTO:Eugene@appsterdam.rs
ATTENDEE;PARTSTAT=ACCEPTED;RSVP=TRUE;CN="Eugene Koontz":MAILTO:Eugene@appsterdam.rs
CATEGORIES:Appsterdam Events
URL:https://meetup.com/appsterdam/events/310984637
