BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:9c49b300dca9422d9d7998fececa3b97@events.appsterdam.rs
SUMMARY:Appsterdam HQ Housewarming Party!
DESCRIPTION:Come over to our new HQ and help us warm the house! \n\nWe're excited to have a place of our very own at [A Lab](http://www.a-lab.nl/), where Appsterdammers can [work for free](https://github.com/Appsterdam/open/blob/master/resources/FreeWorkspace.md)<a href="https://github.com/Appsterdam/open/edit/master/resources/FreeWorkspace.md">&lt;/a&gt;, and where we will hold most of our events. \n\nJoin us for an evening of food, drinks, and a tour of the facilities. We will also visit our neighbors, &lt;a href="http://www.protospace.nl/protospace-aan-het-ij"&gt;Protospace</a>--A Lab's in-house fablab--who will demonstrate some of the equipment they have available. AND we'll take you for a tour around the building!\n\nA €5 donation is appreciated. Payable now through PayPal or at the event in cash. Donate €20 or more and receive an Appsterdam shirt!\n\n16:30 Doors open\n\n17:30 Visit to [Protospace](http://www.protospace.nl/protospace-aan-het-ij)\n\n18:30 Tour of [A Lab](http://www.a-lab.nl/)\n\n21:00 End of event\n\n
DTSTART:20130823T143000
DTEND:20130823T190000
LOCATION:A Lab, Overhoeksplein 2, 1031 KS, Amsterdam, Amsterdam
CLASS:PUBLIC
STATUS:CONFIRMED
